---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateDisclosure from "../components/AffiliateDisclosure.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="Affiliate disclosure for Creator Growth Tools.">
  <section class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Disclosure</p>
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <AffiliateDisclosure />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Some articles on this site may contain affiliate links. If you click a link and purchase a product, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.</p>
      <p>Right now, beehiiv is the only active affiliate relationship on this site. Links to Kit, ActiveCampaign, and any other product go straight to that product's own website and earn us nothing. Each link on the site is labelled "Affiliate link" or "Official site" so you can tell which is which without checking this page.</p>
      <p>Affiliate relationships do not determine whether a product is included. Articles may include non-affiliate alternatives when they are useful to the reader.</p>
      <p>Pricing, commissions, cookie periods, and program terms can change. Always verify current details on the official vendor website before purchasing or joining any program.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
